Bubble Zoom models
==================

This directory bundles the on-device models used by the reader's "Bubble Zoom"
feature. All are redistributed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Speech-bubble and text detection
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Name:     comic-text-and-bubble-detector ("detector-v4-s")
  Author:   ogkalu
  Upstream: https://huggingface.co/ogkalu/comic-text-and-bubble-detector
  Commit:   16e8a622f91fabc6b5b65c96d32d1183f8843546
  Licence:  Apache License 2.0

  RT-DETR-v2 detector (classes: bubble, text_bubble, text_free) trained on
  manga, webtoon, manhua and western comic pages.

  Bundled artifact:
    bubble_detector_v4s.tflite
      Converted from upstream detector-v4-s_int8.onnx: weights de-quantized to
      fp32, batch fixed to 1, output boxes normalised (orig_target_sizes folded
      to 1), a no-op floor-division sign fix-up in the post-processing removed,
      converted to a SavedModel with onnx2tf (Erf replaced by a builtin
      approximation), then to TFLite with the TensorFlow 2.16 converter (op
      versions matching the bundled runtime) and dynamic-range int8 weights.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. Cutout refinement (SAM)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Name:     EdgeSAM
  Authors:  Chong Zhou et al. (S-Lab, Nanyang Technological University)
  Upstream: https://github.com/chongzhou96/EdgeSAM
  Licence:  Apache License 2.0

